WEBVTT

00:03:28.724 --> 00:03:30.629
when I'm having a conversation with you,

00:03:30.653 --> 00:03:32.195
so I'll kind of go off --

00:03:32.219 --> 00:03:33.643
(Laughter)

00:03:35.091 --> 00:03:38.566
It usually takes me
about 20 minutes to get ready,

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:40.692
which nobody ever believes.

00:03:41.828 --> 00:03:42.978
It's true --

00:03:43.002 --> 00:03:44.152
sometimes.

00:03:44.942 --> 00:03:47.677
So, it's my version
of a t-shirt and jeans.

00:03:47.701 --> 00:03:49.925
(Laughter)

00:03:49.949 --> 00:03:52.104
When I get dressed,
I build like an architect.

00:03:52.892 --> 00:03:55.546
I carefully place things
till I feel they belong.

00:03:56.157 --> 00:03:58.791
Then, I get a lot of my ideas
from lucid dreaming.

00:03:59.180 --> 00:04:01.766
I actually go to sleep
to come up with my ideas,